# Release signing keys trusted by the self-updater (voicespeak/updater.py).
# Format: git/OpenSSH allowed_signers, one key per line:
#   <identity> namespaces="git" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... <comment>
# With no key line here the updater refuses every update (fail closed).
# Changes here only reach a box through a release signed by a key already
# trusted on that box, so add a new key before retiring the old one.
